flowchart TD
    OrderCreated["1️⃣ Razorpay Order Created"] --> AttemptPayment["2️⃣ Attempt Initial Payment Rail"]
    AttemptPayment -->|Failure Simulated/Encountered| FailEvent["3️⃣ Payment Failed Event"]
    FailEvent --> CheckPolicy{"4️⃣ Bounded Recovery Policy"}
    CheckPolicy -->|Within Budget & Cap| FallbackLink["5️⃣ Issue Safe Payment Link / Retry"]
    CheckPolicy -->|Exceeds Bound| Terminate["⛔ Halt Transaction"]
    FallbackLink --> AuditRecord["6️⃣ Append to Tamper-Evident Ledger"]
    Terminate --> AuditRecord
